    {
      "id": "1d864b32-cef1-4fcc-8f19-a396920b9139",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "```text\n📁 posexyz \n├── 📁 comic_high \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram10 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram12 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram14 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram16 \n│   └── 📁 spritesheet-fram8 \n\n│   │        └──  🌐 HTML  = gif-vergleich.html\n├── 📁 comic_low \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram10 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram12 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram14 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram16 \n│   └── 📁 spritesheet-fram8 \n├── 📁 comic_mid \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram10 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram12 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram14 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram16 \n│   └── 📁 spritesheet-fram8 \n├── 📁 pixel_high \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram10 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram12 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram14 \n│   ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram16 \n│   └── 📁 spritesheet-fram8 \n└── 📁 pixel_low \n    ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram10 \n    ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram12 \n    ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram14 \n    ├── 📁 spritesheet-fram16 \n    └── 📁 spritesheet-fram8\n 🌐 HTML = aufloesungsvergleich.html\n```",
      "x": 1584,
      "y": -96,
      "width": 576,
      "height": 984,
      "mdvieweditor": {
        "version": 1,
        "textMode": "markdown"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3037fccf-f7cc-4b3d-aa40-5f01a7e5974f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "```text\n📁 paosxyzX  \n├── 📁 comic_high \n├── 📁 comic_low \n├── 📁 comic_mid \n├── 📁 pixel_high \n└── 📁 pixel_low \n📁 paosxyzX  \n├── 📁 comic_high \n├── 📁 comic_low \n├── 📁 comic_mid \n├── 📁 pixel_high \n└── 📁 pixel_low \n📁 paosxyzX \n├── 📁 comic_high \n├── 📁 comic_low \n├── 📁 comic_mid \n├── 📁 pixel_high \n└── 📁 pixel_low \n 🌐 HTML = Größe Positzionsvergleich\n```",
      "x": 144,
      "y": 216,
      "width": 384,
      "height": 624,
      "mdvieweditor": {
        "version": 1,
        "textMode": "markdown"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "933c56aa-e0de-4600-b917-8db0d00163c3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Vor PNG/GIF/HTML: Ziel + Modus prüfen\n--dry-run: nur prüfen\nNormal: Fehlendes ergänzen\n--overwrite: Ausgaben neu erstellen\n--dry-run --overwrite: nur Plan\nGilt für die gewählte Verarbeitung.\nOriginale + fremde Dateien behalten.",
      "mdvieweditor": {
        "version": 1,
        "textMode": "plain"
      },
      "x": 120,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 456,
      "height": 240,
      "label": "🐍 PyPipelineOutputs.py",
      "color": "#249c98"
    }
